# Display Manager & DE Base
sddm
# xorg-server and the xf86-video-* drivers are NOT listed here. They depend
# on xorg-server, which collides with its dep xorg-server-common over
# /usr/lib/Xorg (dir vs file) when installed inside the single pacstrap
# transaction -- this used to abort the whole ISO build with
# `error: extract: not overwriting dir with file /usr/lib/Xorg`.
# Instead they are installed post-pacstrap in customize_airootfs.sh, where
# /usr/lib/Xorg/ already exists and xorg-server's wrapper drops in cleanly.
xorg-xwayland
wayland

