# Required by the shipped PyQt5 GUI tools: zohara-welcome (autostarted on every
# desktop login), zohara-usermgr (app menu entry), zohara-migrate and
# zohara-update. Without this the ISO contains zero PyQt5 files and all four die
# instantly with "ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'PyQt5'".
# TODO: these tools would ideally be ported to the already-present pyside6 so the
# image doesn't carry both Qt5 and Qt6 stacks.
